Config/ReleaseTier.swtier: fallback low; 1 mandatory, 26 optional

setting                use        minimum  fallback  low       medium    high      ultra    
shadow_quality         mandatory  low      low       low       medium    high      ultra    
anti_aliasing          optional   -        fxaa      fxaa      fxaa      fxaa      fxaa     
bloom_quality          optional   -        low       low       medium    high      high     
ambient_occlusion      optional   -        off       off       low       medium    high     
baked_lighting         optional   -        true      true      true      true      true     
reflection_probes      optional   -        true      true      true      true      true     
decals_quality         optional   -        low       low       medium    high      high     
soft_particles         optional   -        false     false     true      true      true     
particle_distortion    optional   -        false     false     true      true      true     
particle_lighting      optional   -        simple    simple    scene     scene     scene    
particle_motion_vectors optional   -        false     false     true      true      true     
color_grading          optional   -        true      true      true      true      true     
depth_of_field         optional   -        true      true      true      true      true     
auto_exposure          optional   -        true      true      true      true      true     
fog_quality            optional   -        analytic  analytic  low       medium    high     
clearcoat              optional   -        true      true      true      true      true     
transmission_quality   optional   -        low       low       medium    medium    high     
skin_quality           optional   -        off       off       low       high      high     
hair_quality           optional   -        low       low       high      high      high     
terrain_quality        optional   -        low       low       low       high      high     
water_quality          optional   -        low       low       low       high      high     
material_graphs        optional   -        true      true      true      true      true     
contact_shadows        optional   -        off       off       off       on        on       
reflections_quality    optional   -        off       off       off       medium    high     
texture_quality        optional   -        low       low       medium    high      ultra    
material_quality       optional   -        low       low       high      high      high     
anisotropy             optional   -        4         4         8         16        16       

mandatory shadow_quality: the sun's shadows are how the rooms read as lit spaces
